## Color and Opacity at a ColorSamples count of 5, bare then bracketed, each followed by
## a Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "colorsamples_5.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 0.125 0.25 0.375 0.5 0.625
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Color [ 0.75 0.875 1 1.125 1.25 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity 1.375 1.5 1.625 1.75 1.875
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity [ 2 2.125 2.25 2.375 2.5 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
